{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"501739c9dc7ed493e1fc8eef2d05f34132403f2e5dc642d2315a63330a146231","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"a7c20343e019cce5d4df8b82cc25c868d4ba6f6257b3331ad8640c80d2b0ecf1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"slumbering-caves.lua:75 “AMAKTHEL's wrath shall be delectable”被译成「愤怒将无可抵挡」。delectable 的意思是“令人愉悦、可口”，这里表达的是狂信者期待看到神怒的快意，译文把意思改掉了。另外，:89 “we will find the heretics together”被译成「我们将亲自对背教者发动复仇」：原文的“与你一起（together）”被丢掉，还凭空加了“复仇”，而原文只说“找出”背教者。"},{"revision_key":"a7d3a8df22f2b82ee20d41d039e3fdb864ac4f2d929468a57026d9c24f0cf9ce","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a87cc074189917d74468c64bc87817a3c69cfd42f49f16d32b51f93621f3c3c7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"a9d2942514aebb65224ae0806a4725fdcb5d5abcda0e188bb8ddc492555d5fe7","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ab005d53a8a9ce237b391f31a1e77297bead08c229d1cacd3c4f5dbcf0f17c50","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"ac38d13dc57f0dfd674cae664fe1acfc460074be2207a9adb2b1b49d8726276a","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"world-artifacts.lua:746 的 special_on_crit desc 明确写的是“dealing physical damage equal to 25% of the original damage”，译文「造成25%原伤害值的伤害」漏掉了伤害类型“物理”，玩家看不出这次爆炸的伤害类型。应补回，例如「造成相当于原伤害25%的物理伤害」。"},{"revision_key":"ac986bd586ae5c6fe2e37037e175e03a739b6f0c7571630799cdad1d98e50cd5","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"acd4f8ee23c9a291bca9d16d3f194e39fe86647ce0887fe71d35413f530519fc","verdict":"OK"}]}